external GPL-2.0 dependency and is not copied into this source tree. The local patch
set needed by this build is included under patches/exlaunch/.

Source: https://github.com/shadowninja108/exlaunch

The CMake Switch helpers are adapted from switch-cmake by vbe0201, under the MIT
License. Host tests use doctest v2.4.11 by Viktor Kirilov, also under the MIT License.

Sources:
https://github.com/vbe0201/switch-cmake
https://github.com/doctest/doctest

The source repository does not contain Nintendo game data or the runtime font and
shader files. The binary mod archive contains eight separate runtime data files so
the mod works after installation. Seven match files distributed with LotusKit. The
JIS1 mipmap font texture was modified to add the icons used by Zonai Survey. Those
data files are not relicensed under GPL-2.0-only, and all rights in them remain with
their respective rights holders.
